Node ID=10 others
Text=Gone up. All of them, the first night, with their hands tied, up the stair and out, and the ones who could not walk were carried. She wanted the house empty and she did not want it burned. Except me. Somebody has to answer the door when the next one comes, and an old man with no legs to run on is cheap to feed.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Where did they take them?
