Node ID=20 drain
Text=Under your straw there is a drain. The abbot's grandfather cut it for the water, and it runs under the wall and comes up in the passage by the stair, behind where that one sits. It is wider than a man, if the man is not proud. I have known about it for forty years. Look at me and tell me what good it did.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Why have you not used it?
Go to node ID=21 legs

Requirement=!None
Reply Text=Thank you, brother.
