Node ID=21 legs
Text=<He lifts the edge of the habit. What is under it was done with care.> I told you. No legs to crawl on either. Go on. And if you can, when she is done with you, come back with the keys. I would like to lie down somewhere that is not this.
Should Have Voiceover=0

Requirement=!None
